o people didn't come into contact  as much with people speaking a different  language but we're now back into a  global village thanks to the internet  thanks through the to the diffusion of  all of these  media  uh you know uh multimedia products uh in  different languages and so i can read my  portuguese newspaper my chinese  newspaper right here sitting at home so  that's the kind of research and  technology that has brought us  to a better language learning  environment including the internet  including link  but i really do believe that the  linguistics research the research and  how we learn and all that kind of stuff  is largely a waste of time  and probably more than that  counterproductive because it over  complicates something that is really  quite straightforward and always has  been thank you for listening bye for now
 

